<title>FINLAND: Nokia shrs brokered at FIM 385.10-385.20.</title>
<headline>Nokia shrs brokered at FIM 385.10-385.20.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Helsinki stock exchange said in a statement on Thursday Svenska Handelsbanken had brokered in-house a total of 4.5 million Nokia A-series shares at 385.10-385.20 markka per share in after-market trading.</p>
<p>It said 4.05 million Nokia A shares had been transacted at 385.10 markka each and 450,000 shares at 385.20 markka each.</p>
<p>Brokers said the transactions were the sale by forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy of 4.5 million Nokia shares to U.S. investment bank Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
